Licensing of the z3/ workload
=============================

Material derived from Z3 (https://github.com/Z3Prover/z3, release tag z3-5.3.3,
commit 430d19e697e2ec9bad79ff210d41b4a7a5fcfa3e): the injection patches
(bugs/*/injection.patch, patches/), and the Z3 unit-test names, code excerpts,
SMT-LIB inputs taken from Z3's unit tests, and commit messages quoted in
oracle.json, meta.json, RATIONALE.md and some reproducers (bugs/*/repro.smt2).
It is licensed under Z3's MIT license, reproduced verbatim below (LICENSE.txt at
tag z3-5.3.3).
Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation.

Material derived from the z3test regression repository
(https://github.com/Z3Prover/z3test, commit aff10a93980481ae9928c0f6d95dfbc2f561fdbf):
the regression inputs and their expected outputs vendored under
bugs/*/z3test/ (used as oracles for the bugs whose meta.json has
"pool": "z3test"), and z3test file names quoted in oracle.json and meta.json.
It is licensed under z3test's own license, reproduced verbatim below
(LICENSE.txt at that commit).
Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation.

Everything else in this directory (the bin/ scripts, tool/, the README,
marauder.toml, bugs.csv, bugs.json, the reproducers written for this workload
(bugs/*/repro.smt2 except for SMT-LIB inputs quoted from Z3 as described above,
bugs/*/repro.expected.clean, bugs/*/repro.expected.buggy), and the labels and
verification records in meta.json, oracle.json and RATIONALE.md) is Copyright
Datadog, Inc. and licensed under the Apache License 2.0 (../LICENSE).

The following is the Z3 license at tag z3-5.3.3
(https://github.com/Z3Prover/z3/blob/z3-5.3.3/LICENSE.txt), verbatim:

